  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of CIS Statistical Infrastructure and Development of CIS-Stat&#x2019;s Web-portal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of the project are to i) create a central database and web-portal for the CIS-STAT to maintain and disseminate statistical information and knowledge; ii) introduce advanced information technologies enabling more automated statistical data collection and processing between CIS-STAT and the CIS National Statistical Offices (NSOs); and iii) harmonize content of the CISNSO websites through introducing common data sharing and dissemination technologies and channels.</narrative>
  </description>
